WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.140
It's freezing outside.

2
00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:04.390
Your French friend shivers and says:

3
00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:06.190
«Il fait froid.» Word for word,

4
00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:08.760
that's 'it makes cold'.

5
00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:11.470
Makes? Who is making anything?

6
00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:13.910
Then you spot a sign on the school wall:

7
00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:15.460
«Il faut arriver à l'heure».

8
00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:17.580
You must arrive on time.

9
00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:21.610
Cold weather, strict rules, and
the same little word in front:

10
00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:24.050
«il». But who is «il»?

11
00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:26.930
In this mission, you'll read
a weather map of France,

12
00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:28.960
from sunshine to snow.

13
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:31.840
Then you'll decode a
noticeboard of school rules,

14
00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:33.660
sign by sign.

15
00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:37.530
Your mission: find out who
the French 'it' really is,

16
00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:39.140
and make it work for weather,

17
00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:40.590
rules and advice.
